(d) respond to an emergency when no vaccinated person is available.

Unvaccinated individuals may drive or board commercial or public transport to:
(a) perform a law enforcement function (excluding security officers or authorized persons on public transport);
(b) fulfill a statutory duty under Commonwealth law;
(c) exercise rights under a Fair Work, Work Health and Safety, or Industrial Relations Act entry permit; or
(d) respond to an emergency when no vaccinated person is available.

